data/atlas_parsed.csv and data/atlas_coverage.csv are derived from the LNP
Atlas database by Song, S., Baek, J. and Seo, S., released under CC BY 4.0 at
https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.17243733. They are redistributed here under the
same license, with attribution to its authors. No original values were altered;
the added proc_* columns are parsed from the database's own free-text
synthesis_info field.
